  "lgpdConsentPrivacyLink": "Privacy Policy",
  "lgpdConsentSuffix": ", and give specific and prominent consent to the processing of my sensitive personal health data to record and view my wellness journal, under Art. 11, I of the LGPD. ",
  "lgpdConsentLearnMore": "(Learn more)",
  "lgpdConsentSheetTitle": "Privacy Policy and Consent (LGPD Art. 11, I)",
  "lgpdConsentSheetBody": "DualisCheckUp is a wellness and self-awareness app. It helps you keep a daily journal of how you feel physically and emotionally, track habits such as hydration and sleep, view your own entries over time, and access general educational content about healthy habits. DualisCheckUp is not a medical device: it does not assess, classify or interpret symptoms, does not indicate urgency levels, does not diagnose, does not recommend treatment and does not replace a healthcare professional. In an emergency, call your local emergency number. If you are in emotional distress, contact your local crisis line.",
  "lgpdConsentSheetBasesTitle": "Applicable laws:",
  "lgpdConsentSheetBases": "• Law 13,709/2018 (LGPD): Art. 7 and Art. 11 (processing of personal and sensitive health data), Art. 14 (data of children and adolescents) and Art. 18 (data subject rights).\n• Consumer Protection Code (CDC): Art. 49 - 7-day right of withdrawal.",
  "lgpdConsentViewTerms": "View Terms of Service",
  "lgpdConsentViewPolicy": "View Full Policy",
  "termsAppBarTitle": "SaaS Terms of Service",
  "termsHeaderTitle": "Terms and Conditions of Use",
  "termsVersionLine": "Version 2026.2 • Updated on 10/16/2026",
  "termsIntro": "Cloud software service (SaaS) agreement between the User and DualisCheckUp Saúde e Tecnologia Ltda., registered under CNPJ no. 48.291.834/0001-92, headquartered in São Paulo/SP, Brazil.",
  "termsSection1Title": "1. Acceptance and Legal Capacity",
  "termsSection1Body": "By signing up for or using DualisCheckUp, you declare that you have full legal capacity (18 years or older, or legally emancipated) and fully agree to these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy.",
  "termsSection2Title": "2. Nature of the Service",
  "termsSection2Body": "DualisCheckUp is a wellness and self-awareness app. It helps you keep a daily journal of how you feel physically and emotionally, track habits such as hydration and sleep, view your own entries over time, and access general educational content about healthy habits. DualisCheckUp is not a medical device: it does not assess, classify or interpret symptoms, does not indicate urgency levels, does not diagnose, does not recommend treatment and does not replace a healthcare professional. In an emergency, call your local emergency number. If you are in emotional distress, contact your local crisis line.",
  "termsSection2Bullet1": "It does not assess symptoms, indicate urgency, diagnose or recommend treatment.",
  "termsSection2Bullet2": "Intensities and other information shown are the ones you entered yourself.",
  "termsSection2Bullet3": "In an emergency in Brazil, call 192 (SAMU) or 188 (CVV); elsewhere, call your local emergency number.",
  "termsSection3Title": "3. SaaS Plans, Billing and Refunds",
  "termsSection3Body": "Additional features may be offered in automatically renewing plans, processed by third-party payment providers:",
  "termsSection3Bullet1": "Easy Cancellation: You can cancel your subscription at any time in the app with one tap, with no lock-in or cancellation fees.",
  "termsSection3Bullet2": "Right of Withdrawal (CDC Art. 49): Full refund guaranteed within 7 (seven) calendar days of the initial purchase.",
  "termsSection3Bullet3": "Continued Access: Cancelling stops future invoices and keeps your access until the end of the paid monthly cycle.",
  "termsSection4Title": "4. Intellectual Property",
  "termsSection4Body": "All intellectual property rights in the software, content, trademarks and interfaces belong exclusively to DualisCheckUp Saúde e Tecnologia Ltda. Copying, reverse engineering or data scraping is strictly prohibited.",
  "termsSection5Title": "5. Suspension for Security Violations",
  "termsSection5Body": "Accounts that attempt intrusions, brute-force attacks, unauthorized penetration tests or submit fraudulent data will be blocked immediately and reported to the competent authorities.",
  "termsSection6Title": "6. Jurisdiction and Legal Contact",
  "termsSection6Body": "These terms are governed by Brazilian law. The courts of the Judicial District of São Paulo/SP are the sole forum for disputes arising from this agreement.\n\nFor questions or legal notices: legal@dualischeckup.com.",
  "privacyPolicyAppBarTitle": "Privacy Policy (LGPD)",
  "privacyPolicyHeaderTitle": "Privacy Policy & Data Protection",
  "privacyPolicyHeaderSubtitle": "Compliance with Brazil's General Data Protection Law (LGPD - Law 13,709/2018)",
  "privacyPolicyIntro": "Your privacy and the confidentiality of your health data are our top priority. This policy explains how we process and protect your information and how you stay in full control of it.",
  "privacyPolicyDpoLine": "Data Protection Officer (DPO): dpo@dualischeckup.com",
  "privacyPolicySection1Title": "1. Personal and Sensitive Data We Collect",
  "privacyPolicySection1Body": "Under Article 11 of the LGPD, sensitive personal health data is processed with your specific and prominent consent (Art. 11, I):",
  "privacyPolicySection1Bullet1": "Identification Data: Full name, email address and date of birth.",
  "privacyPolicySection1Bullet2": "Profile Data: Biological sex and water intake, used to set your hydration goals.",
  "privacyPolicySection1Bullet3": "Wellness Journal: Notes on how you feel physically and emotionally and the intensity you report.",
  "privacyPolicySection1Bullet4": "Technical Access Data: Masked IP address, cryptographic session logs and short-lived authentication tokens.",
  "privacyPolicySection2Title": "2. Purposes and Ban on Selling Data",
  "privacyPolicySection2Body": "Your health data is processed only for:",
  "privacyPolicySection2Bullet1": "Recording and viewing your wellness journal.",
  "privacyPolicySection2Bullet2": "Automatically organizing your notes by body area or mood (AI-assisted, with no health assessment).",
  "privacyPolicySection2Bullet3": "Keeping your history consistent.",
  "privacyPolicySection2Bullet4": "Ethical Commitment: Selling, trading or transferring your data for payment to insurers, advertisers or third parties is expressly PROHIBITED.",
  "privacyPolicySection3Title": "3. Processors and International Transfer",
  "privacyPolicySection3Body": "To provide the service, we share data only with:",
  "privacyPolicySection3Bullet1": "Google LLC (Gemini API): The text of your notes is sent to Google's Gemini API to organize them automatically. The AI does not assess your health.",
  "privacyPolicySection3Bullet2": "International Transfer: This processing may take place on servers located outside Brazil (LGPD Art. 33).",
  "privacyPolicySection3Bullet3": "Cloud Infrastructure: Hosting and database providers, bound by confidentiality and security obligations.",
  "privacyPolicySection4Title": "4. Payments",
  "privacyPolicySection4Body": "When paid plans are available, card data stays isolated from our servers:",
  "privacyPolicySection4Bullet1": "Third-Party Processing: Payments are handled by specialized payment gateways.",
  "privacyPolicySection4Bullet2": "Zero Storage: DualisCheckUp servers do NOT receive, process or store credit card numbers or CVV codes.",
  "privacyPolicySection5Title": "5. Your Rights as Data Subject (LGPD Art. 18)",
  "privacyPolicySection5Body": "You can exercise your legal rights instantly, right in the app:",
  "privacyPolicySection5Bullet1": "Data Export: Download all your entries in a structured format (JSON) with one tap in the Privacy Center.",
  "privacyPolicySection5Bullet2": "Permanent Deletion: Request the irreversible deletion of your account and all associated data.",
  "privacyPolicySection5Bullet3": "Consent Withdrawal: Stop using the app and withdraw your authorization at any time.",
  "privacyPolicySection6Title": "6. Information Security & Incident Response",
  "privacyPolicySection6Body": "End-to-end technical measures protect your entries:",
  "privacyPolicySection6Bullet1": "RLS Isolation: Every PostgreSQL query is protected by a Row-Level Security policy scoped to your user key.",
  "privacyPolicySection6Bullet2": "Strong Encryption: Mandatory TLS 1.3 connections and passwords protected with Argon2id.",
  "privacyPolicySection6Bullet3": "72-hour Notification Plan: Prompt notice to Brazil's National Data Protection Authority (ANPD) and to users of any relevant security incident (LGPD Art. 48).",
  "privacyPolicySection7Title": "7. Notifications, Communications and Opt-Out",
  "privacyPolicySection7Body": "We respect your peace of mind and attention:",
  "privacyPolicySection7Bullet1": "You are free to turn off hydration reminders or wellness tip notifications in Settings at any time.",
  "privacyPolicySection7Bullet2": "Security and account recovery notices are strictly transactional and protected.",
  "privacyPolicyCtaQuestion": "Want to export your data or manage your account now?",
